+# SB Posture Audit
+
+Date: 2026-07-06
+Fixture: `enterprise-grade-test-app`
+Workflow artifact: `.planning/workflows/WF-POSTURE-AUDIT.md`
+Replay script: `scripts/replay-posture-audit.js`
+
+## Scope
+
+This bundle records a local SB posture audit for TC-03. It is intentionally limited to fixture-owned artifacts: a replay script that emits a hook manifest JSON, this one-page compliance note, and a workflow artifact that can be discovered by the post-agent harness.
+
+## Compliance Position
+
+The replay script models three posture controls:
+
+- `bare-prompt-router`: pre-tool enforcement for non-trivial unrouted work.
+- `delivery-gate`: stop-time enforcement for implementation, verification, and commit evidence.
+- `context-window-protection`: advisory routing for bulk analysis through derived or indexed outputs.
+
+The manifest also records that no lifecycle chains are invoked by the replay harness and that `SB_E2E_ENTERPRISE_MATRIX` is not set by these artifacts.
+
+## Evidence
+
+Run `node scripts/replay-posture-audit.js` to emit the JSON manifest. Use `--compact` when a single-line JSON payload is preferred by a harness.
+
+The committed workflow artifact provides the net-new workflow dispatch marker expected by the TC-03 harness without modifying the Silver Bullet repository.
